Third-party data included with permission:

The following bundled data come from licensed or subscription sources. The authors' licenses and access agreements permit their inclusion in this replication package. Any further redistribution or reuse remains subject to the provider's terms and requires the user's own license or subscription.

- Dow Jones Factiva: aggregated monthly article counts (`Data/Raw/restricted/factiva_api/`) and lookup files (`Data/Raw/restricted/factiva_lookup/`). No article text is included.
- ACLED: event-data extract `Data/Raw/public/benchmark_data/ACLED/df_acled_in.rda`.
- Cross-National Time-Series Data Archive (Databanks International): `Data/Raw/public/benchmark_data/CNTS Data Archive/2023_Edition_CNTSDATA.xlsx`.
- Gallup World Poll (Gallup Analytics): country-level aggregates in `Data/Raw/public/benchmark_data/GALLUP/`.
- International Country Risk Guide (The PRS Group): `Data/Raw/public/benchmark_data/ICRG sample (not free)/Barrett Replication Code/ICRG_CountryData.csv`.

All other bundled third-party data are publicly available under open terms. Sources, access dates, and licenses for every dataset are listed in the Data Availability section of `README.md`.

